{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026c6iFMBDWHc1792943328.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>於馬鞍山上演的中國手球超級聯賽，港隊10分不敵北京。</p><p></p><p>全運銅牌戰「翻版」，上半場分數緊咬，白衫的港隊，半場落後2分，北京換邊後拉開，更令港隊下半場只得10分，港隊的連潤滔攻入全隊最高9分，最終都輸27-37，星期二會對江蘇。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:42.497370+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T15:48:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T05:18:05.258883+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:40:26.956448+00:00","content_hash":"fa8bc16f46a9e920b7dffe9600c063697e80de0bf07631649d03e9e3345af062","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:42.497370+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}